  Id: CommanderMode
  Title: Commander overview
  Pages:
  - Expand the minimap for a strategic view of the SAME battlefield. Select cells
    or towers on the map to build, inspect, upgrade, repair, or sell.
  - Drag to pan and use zoom controls or the mouse wheel. Close overview to return
    to physical movement. Construction previews and resource balances stay shared.
